  "description": "\"Today, every demonkind in the world will disappear.\"\n\nThe ‘Continental Demon-Sealing Formation,’ humanity’s final card to end the 100-year war against the demonkind.\n\nThe hero Part and imperial mage Noah, dispatched to complete this mission.\n\nTogether with Roro, a young shepherd boy they met at their final destination, they finally stand on the verge of completing the great plan.\n\nAnd on that day, everything was turned upside down.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=854402), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14660430)",
